      "content": "I hear how desperate and overwhelming you feel, and I want to reassure you that this sense of hollowness is a profound psychological experience, not a failure of self-care. You are describing a symptom of severe depression or \"depersonalization,\" where the self feels disconnected from one's own life to the point where the world no longer seems to matter.\n\nPlease do not try to \"push through\" this with more routine; instead, consider reaching out to a mental health professional who can help you identify the root of this disconnection safely. You do not have to carry this \"severed limb\" feeling alone, and healing is possible even when the pain feels permanent. I encourage you to make a call to a crisis line or therapy help to get support as soon as you can.",
