      "content": "therapy, crisis lines... it just feels like more noise. more stuff to manage. more things on a calendar that i have to perform for. i'm just so tired of the struggle to \"get better\" or \"heal.\" what if there's nothing to come back to? what if the only real peace is just... not having to do this anymore? just total, absolute silence. it sounds so much more peaceful than everything else.",
